/E (Established in 1979 by Abdullah Al Shaali, AS Marine has inherited the proud boat building tradition that has earned the legendary Arabian seafarer and his crafts a proud place in world maritime history. Translated into modern design and technology, this tradition remains the foundation and mission of the AS Marine boats' building process. From the factory complex in the United Arab Emirates, a wide product range of luxury flybridge yachts are manufactured for domestic and worldwide markets)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [2]
