/E (AS Marine has received numerous awards from leading international bodies and won many of the industries famous quality certificates. AS Marine shows a combination of talent where design pleases, performance excites, and seagoing dependability means the safety and comfort of the owner and guest. Our signature is beauty and pride, and our clients receive nothing less. Look no further, you can truly have it all! AS Marine is making smart boating decisions easy)
